  "content": {
    "id": "p33-q8-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "A number is selected at random from the integers 1 to 100 inclusive. What is the probability it is:",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p33-q8-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "divisible by 3?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{33}{100}$",
          "worked": "The multiples are $3,6,\\ldots,99$, giving $99\\div3=33$ favourable outcomes out of 100 equally likely integers.\n\n$$P(\\text{divisible by }3)=\\frac{33}{100}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p33-q8-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "divisible by 7?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{7}{50}$",
          "worked": "The multiples are $7,14,\\ldots,98$, giving $98\\div7=14$ favourable outcomes.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{divisible by }7)&=\\frac{14}{100}\\\\P(\\text{divisible by }7)&=\\frac{7}{50}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 27
      },
      {
        "id": "p33-q8-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "divisible by both 3 and 7?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{1}{25}$",
          "worked": "A number divisible by both 3 and 7 is a multiple of 21. The favourable outcomes are $21,42,63,84$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{divisible by both }3\\text{ and }7)&=\\frac{4}{100}\\\\P(\\text{divisible by both }3\\text{ and }7)&=\\frac{1}{25}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p33-q8-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "divisible by 3 but not by 7?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{29}{100}$",
          "worked": "Of the 33 multiples of 3, four are also multiples of 7. There are $33-4=29$ favourable outcomes.\n\n$$P(\\text{divisible by }3\\text{ but not }7)=\\frac{29}{100}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 27
      },
      {
        "id": "p33-q8-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "divisible by 7 but not by 3?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{1}{10}$",
          "worked": "Of the 14 multiples of 7, four are also multiples of 3. There are $14-4=10$ favourable outcomes.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{divisible by }7\\text{ but not }3)&=\\frac{10}{100}\\\\P(\\text{divisible by }7\\text{ but not }3)&=\\frac{1}{10}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      }
    ]
  },
